docs {
  Saves institutions_across_world tab payload using PATCH /api/v1/college-admin/profile.

  Important:
  - This request writes `profileSections` as provided.
  - If your college already has other section data, merge current `profileSections`
    from GET /api/v1/college-admin/profile first, then replace only
    `institutions_across_world`.

  Note:
  - GET /api/v1/college-admin/profile/sections returns this section from
    institution-group membership data.
}